      "writtenOn": "2025-11-24T17:24:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agree with std::span\u003c\u003e, though chrome in general isn\u0027t fond of std::byte. In this case, these are typically pixel values upon which we\u0027d like to perform arithmetic without having to cast.",
